16 md:pt-24 pb-16 md:pb-24 max-w-screen overflow-x-hidden lg:overflow-x-visible bg-white text-plum"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 lg:px-4 relative"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-16 lg:mb-24"><div><span class="block text-current opacity-80 empty:mb-0 empty:hidden text-body-label mb-2">YOUR SUPPORT SYSTEM</span></div><div><h2 class="whitespace-pre-wrap empty:hidden text-e5 md:text-e4 text-balance">Human care, enhanced by technology</h2></div><div><div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-stretch relative gap-x-10"><div class="flex-1"><div index="0" class="w-full max-w-[600px] mx-auto lg:h-[540px] flex flex-col justify-center mb-16 last:mb-0 lg:mb-0"><div class="mb-4 max-w-[600px] lg:h-[540px] relative flex items-stretch lg:hidden"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27600%27%20height=%27540%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Woman packing a box" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="rounded-2xl" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center"/><noscript><img alt="Woman packing a box" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center" class="rounded-2xl" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2Fc8a28b697d654c781e823ba439c8728bf95c7401-1200x1080.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2Fc8a28b697d654c781e823ba439c8728bf95c7401-1200x1080.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2Fc8a28b697d654c781e823ba439c8728bf95c7401-1200x1080.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100"/></noscript></span><div class="absolute" style="right:-40px;bottom:-24px;opacity:0"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27203.33333333333334%27%20height=%27217.33333333333334%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Your Care Plan Widget" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fwidget-1.48c4db09.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=100 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fwidget-1.48c4db09.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fwidget-1.48c4db09.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=100" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="right:0;bottom:0;opacity:1;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div><div class="text-h2 lg:text-h1 mt-6 lg:mt-0">Get your bearings—and a plan</div><p class="text-body-large mt-2 lg:mr-14">We&#x27;ll create a personalized Care Plan, tailored to your family&#x27;s most urgent needs, to help you face the challenges of loss.</p></div><div index="1" class="w-full max-w-[600px] mx-auto lg:h-[540px] flex flex-col justify-center mb-16 last:mb-0 lg:mb-0"><div class="mb-4 max-w-[600px] lg:h-[540px] relative flex items-stretch lg:hidden"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27600%27%20height=%27540%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Man holding baby and working on computer" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="rounded-2xl" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center"/><noscript><img alt="Man holding baby and working on computer" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center" class="rounded-2xl" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2F6750b9eb1adfb633729f4e4474b2d29011b869c0-1200x1080.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2F6750b9eb1adfb633729f4e4474b2d29011b869c0-1200x1080.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2F6750b9eb1adfb633729f4e4474b2d29011b869c0-1200x1080.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100"/></noscript></span><div class="absolute" style="right:-40px;top:-24px;opacity:0"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27235.33333333333334%27%20height=%27269%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Closing Accounts Widget including closed Facebook and Comcast (Xfinity) account, and a pending closing of PayPal account" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fwidget-2.579abe98.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=100 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fwidget-2.579abe98.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fwidget-2.579abe98.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=100" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="right:0;top:0;opacity:1;position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%"/></span></div></div><div class="text-h2 lg:text-h1 mt-6 lg:mt-0">Finish your tasks faster</div><p class="text-body-large mt-2 lg:mr-14">Use our time-saving tools to get the benefits you deserve and cancel accounts and subscriptions. </p></div><div index="2" class="w-full max-w-[600px] mx-auto lg:h-[540px] flex flex-col justify-center mb-16 last:mb-0 lg:mb-0"><div class="mb-4 max-w-[600px] lg:h-[540px] relative flex items-stretch lg:hidden"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27600%27%20height=%27540%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="Older woman with grandson" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" class="rounded-2xl" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center"/><noscript><img alt="Older woman with grandson" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center" class="rounded-2xl" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2Fd210595d1474112fcb7e5f7c0a8a10b134c83f29-1200x1080.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F7esgctdt%2Fproduction%2Fd210595d1474112fcb7e5f7c