 Insurance Carriers</a></li><li><a href="/healthplans" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="health-plans-footer">Health Plans</a></li><li><a href="/families" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="families-footer">Families</a></li><li><a href="/product" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="product-footer">Loss Support</a></li><li><a href="/lifevault" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="lifevault-footer">Legacy Planning</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-h4 md:text-h3">Company</h3><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 md:space-y-4"><li><a href="/about" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="about-footer">About</a></li><li><a href="/careers" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="careers__join_the_team_footer">Careers</a></li><li><a href="/news-room" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="news-room-footer">Press</a></li><li><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3c54595050537c59514c5d485445125f5351" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="contact-us-footer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact Us</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-h4 md:text-h3">Resources</h3><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 md:space-y-4"><li><a href="/learn" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="learn-footer">Knowledge Base</a></li><li><a href="/employer-resources" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="employer-resources-footer">Employer Resources</a></li><li><a href="/costofdying" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" id="costofdying-footer">Cost of Dying</a></li><li><a href="/stories" class="text-body-small md:text-body-standard text-plum-80 hover:text-plum" i